      "title": "Madaxweyne Deni oo ku dhawaaqay go’aamo ku aaddan dowladnimada Somalia. - Horseed Media",
      "link": "https://horseedmedia.net/madaxweyne-deni-oo-ku-dhawaaqay-goaamo-ku-aaddan-dowladnimada-somalia/426846/",
